/*
 * Implements validation for the `__pragma!method_has_tag(T, method, tag)`,
 * `__pragma!method_tag(T, method, tag)` and `__pragma!method_tags(T, method, tag)`
 * constructs.
 *
 * The pragmas read at compile time the sites of a tag written on top of the
 * methods of a class, a record or an entity.
 *
 * <hr>
 *
 * @Package: ymirc
 * @Module: ymirc::semantic::validator::pragma::method_tag
 * @File: ymirc/semantic/validator/pragma/method_tag.yr
 * @Author(s):
